        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Creating",
            "id": 127470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando vogliamo usare il nostro modello di classe per creare qualcosa, iniziamo creando una variabile o una costante, come <code>fluffy</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy =\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let</code>, seguito da <code>fluffy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parentheses ",
            "id": 127471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Successivamente, aggiungiamo il nome della classe e le parentesi per crearla, come con <code>VirtualPet()</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>VirtualPet</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Instances",
            "id": 127472,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo variabili dal modello della classe, stiamo creando delle <strong>istanze</strong>. <code>fluffy</code> e <code>benny</code> sono istanze della classe <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" benny = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let benny</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>VirtualPet()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Definition",
            "id": 127473,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La classe <code>VirtualPet</code> che stiamo usando per creare le variabili <code>fluffy</code> si chiama <strong>definizione</strong>. <code>VirtualPet</code> è la definizione, <code>fluffy</code> è un'istanza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"&quot;9&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Variable",
            "id": 127474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere a una variabile di classe, aggiungiamo il nome dell'istanza, un <code>.</code> e il nome della variabile che vogliamo. Come <code>skippy.waggingTail</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" skippy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.waggingTail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"119\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>skippy</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>waggingTail</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Other instances",
            "id": 127475,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo accedere a tutte le variabili che abbiamo creato nella definizione della classe. Accediamo al valore della variabile <code>color</code> scrivendo <code>skippy.color</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" skippy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.waggingTail)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.color)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"brown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>skippy.color</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 127476,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale frammento di codice crea correttamente un'istanza di una classe chiamata <code>Cat</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>let fluffy = Cat()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>let fluffy = VirtualPet()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>let fluffy = Cat()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 127477,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa fa questo codice?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Stiamo definendo una classe e creando un'istanza di essa</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Stiamo solo definendo una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Stiamo definendo una classe e creando un'istanza di essa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 127478,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa sta succedendo in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Stiamo definendo una classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Stiamo creando un'istanza di una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Stiamo definendo una classe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 127479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il modo corretto per accedere alla variabile di un'istanza in Swift?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>instance.variable</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>instance[variable]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>instance.variable</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 127480,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno dell'istruzione <code>print()</code>, visualizza la variabile <code>waggingTail</code> dell'istanza <code>spot</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spot = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(spot.waggingTail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>spot</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>waggingTail</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 127481,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un'istanza della classe <code>Pokemon</code> e memorizzala in una variabile chiamata <code>pokemon</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pokemon = \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Squirtle\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pokemon</code>, seguito da <code>Pokemon</code> e infine <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 127482,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza il colore dell'istanza della classe <code>rocky</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(rocky.color)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>.color</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 127483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una variabile chiamata <code>weight</code> alla definizione della classe e imposta <code>\"19.8\"</code> come valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weight = \" /><text value=\"&quot;19.8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pokemon = \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.weight)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"squirtle\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"19.8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let weight</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"19.8\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
